    "id": "pose_55_sitting_ladylike_reaching_behind",
    "name": "Ladylike floor sitting, reaching back-down",
    "description": "Sitting wariza-style reclined with the chest lifted, both arms reaching back-out toward the floor behind the hips with spread fingers. The head stays level. Left/right are the character's own.",
    "targetModels": [
      "female",
      "male"
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      "Single front-view line drawing used as reference; the bracing hands reach toward the floor but hover with draped fingers because the rig arm (0.565 m) cannot span the sitting shoulder-to-floor distance; the buttocks hover in side view and the knees sit less forward than the drawing because the rig calf limit (140 deg) cannot make the true wariza fold (~160 deg).",
      "Knees share floor contact with toes grazing; root height is the female/male mean within the 10 mm floor tolerance.",
      "Authored on rig/female.glb; the male reuses the same rotations with the hips-height-relative root offset."
    ],
    "generator": "scripts/pose_author/lib.py + /tmp/author_floor.py (poses-only scope; authoring script not committed)"
  },
